  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Đặt tên các điểm như hình vẽ.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>S</mi></semantics></math> là đỉnh của hình chóp tứ giác đều; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> lần lượt là tâm của hình vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (m).<br>Lại có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (m).<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (m).<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> (m<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>3</mn></msup></semantics></math>).</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/7705477dee41cec77603d539c23783c3c29f94bbefa58961d8f4ff55834bde35.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>32</mn><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> (m<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>3</mn></msup></semantics></math>).<br>Thể tích chân tháp là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>32</mn><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>76</mn><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> (m<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>3</mn></msup></semantics></math>).<br>Số tiền mua bê tông làm chân tháp là: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>76</mn><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>284</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (triệu đồng).",
